      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gideon%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town began in 1900 as a lumber company town, growing around the rail lines that crossed the Bootheel.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
